source_evidence_check:
In Cell 96 the repository defines:
def acc(coeffs):
    perm = torch.randperm(len(val_indep))
    shuffled_indep = val_indep[perm]
    return (val_dep.bool()==(calc_preds(coeffs, shuffled_indep)>0.5)).float().mean()
There is no torch.manual_seed() inside acc(), and validation labels (val_dep) are not permuted to match the shuffled inputs, causing nondeterministic and incorrect accuracy computations.
